
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Bulk Inventory Upload | Sky City</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --navy: #082f49;
      --cyan: #00c8f8;
      --violet: #7752df;
      --pink: #ff1493;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }


body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  color: var(--navy);

  background-image:
    linear-gradient(
      rgba(225, 245, 255, 0.10),
      rgba(225, 235, 255, 0.16)
    ),
    url("/images/bulkInventoryUpload.PNG");

  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center center;
  background-repeat: no-repeat;
  background-attachment: fixed;
}

/* SKY CITY — BULK UPLOAD PAGE LAYOUT */

.page {
  width: min(950px, 94%);
  margin: 35px auto;
}

.header {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 25px;
  background: rgba(235, 249, 255, 0.88);
  border-radius: 22px;
  margin-bottom: 22px;
}

h1 {
  margin-bottom: 8px;
  font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
}

.subtitle {
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.panel {
  background: rgba(235, 249, 255, 0.86);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
  border-radius: 22px;
  padding: 30px;
  box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(15, 45, 95, 0.22);
  margin-bottom: 22px;
  backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
}

.upload-zone {
  display: block;
  border: 2px dashed var(--violet);
  border-radius: 18px;
  padding: 40px 20px;
  text-align: center;
  background: rgba(220, 246, 255, 0.65);
  cursor: pointer;
}

.upload-zone strong {
  display: block;
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

input[type="file"] {
  display: block;
  margin: 18px auto 0;
  max-width: 100%;
}

.button {
  display: inline-block;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 13px 22px;
  color: white;
  font-weight: 700;
  text-decoration: none;
  background: linear-gradient(120deg, #007bc3, var(--violet));
}

button:disabled {
  opacity: 0.55;
  cursor: not-allowed;
}

.actions {
  margin-top: 22px;
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
}

.notice {
  padding: 16px;
  border-left: 4px solid var(--pink);
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
  border-radius: 8px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.table-wrap {
  overflow-x: auto;
}

table {
  border-collapse: collapse;
  width: 100%;
  margin-top: 15px;
}

th, td {
  border-bottom: 1px solid #bad7e8;
  padding: 12px;
  text-align: left;
}

th {
  background: #d9f3ff;
}

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .panel {
    padding: 18px;
  }
}

/* ==========================================
   SKY CITY — CLEAR TRANSPARENT PANELS
   ========================================== */

.header,
.panel {
  background: rgba(225, 245, 255, 0.16);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(5, 35, 85, 0.18);

  /* Remove frosted-glass blur */
  backdrop-filter: none;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: none;
}

.upload-zone {
  background: rgba(220, 246, 255, 0.18);
  border: 2px dashed #7752df;
  backdrop-filter: none;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: none;
}

.notice {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.70);
}

th {
  background: rgba(205, 239, 255, 0.75);
}

td {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
}

/* SKY CITY — TRANSPARENT PANEL READABILITY */

.header,
.panel {
  background: rgba(225, 245, 255, 0.12);
  backdrop-filter: none;
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: none;
}

.header h1,
.panel h2 {
  color: #052b49;
  font-weight: 800;
  text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
}

.header p,
.panel p,
.upload-zone {
  color: #052b49;
  text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
}

.table-wrap {
  background: rgba(235, 249, 255, 0.30);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 8px;
}

th {
  background: rgba(215, 242, 255, 0.82);
  color: #052b49;
}

td {
  background: rgba(235, 249, 255, 0.58);
  color: #052b49;
}

.notice {
  background: rgba(245, 251, 255, 0.78);
  color: #052b49;
}
/* SKY CITY — FINAL TEXT CONTRAST */

.header h1,
.panel h2,
.upload-zone strong {
  color: #032b49;
  font-weight: 800;
  text-shadow:
    0 1px 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95),
    0 0 8px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
}

.header p,
.panel p,
.upload-zone {
  color: #032b49;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-shadow:
    0 1px 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95),
    0 0 6px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
}

.upload-zone {
  background: rgba(225, 245, 255, 0.24);
}

.panel .notice {
  background: rgba(245, 251, 255, 0.82);
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* ==========================================
   SKY CITY — SPREADSHEET READABILITY
   ========================================== */

.table-wrap {
  background: rgba(235, 249, 255, 0.88);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 8px;
  overflow-x: auto;
}

.table-wrap table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
}

.table-wrap th {
  background: rgba(185, 230, 255, 0.96);
  color: #052b49;
  font-weight: 800;
  text-shadow: none;
}

.table-wrap td {
  background: rgba(245, 251, 255, 0.94);
  color: #052b49;
  font-weight: 600;
  text-shadow: none;
}

.table-wrap th,
.table-wrap td {
  padding: 13px 12px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #b8d7e8;
  text-align: left;
}

  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <main class="page">
    <header class="header">
      <h1>Bulk Inventory Upload</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">
        <strong><%= business.businessName %></strong>
        <br>
        Import multiple products and services using CSV or Excel.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2>Upload Your Inventory</h2>


<form
  id="inventoryUploadForm"
  action="/business-listings/<%= business._id %>/items/bulk-upload/preview"
  method="POST"
  enctype="multipart/form-data"
  data-csrf-token="<%= businessInventoryCsrfToken %>"
>
  <label class="upload-zone" for="inventoryFile">
    <strong>Select your inventory spreadsheet</strong>
    Supported formats: .csv and .xlsx

    <input
      type="file"
      id="inventoryFile"
      name="inventoryFile"
      accept=".csv,.xlsx"
      required
    >
  </label>

  <div class="actions">
    <button class="button" type="submit">
      Preview Inventory
    </button>

    <a class="button" href="/business/<%= business._id %>">
      Back to Storefront
    </a>
  </div>
</form>

<section
  id="inventoryPreviewResult"
  class="panel"
  aria-live="polite"
  hidden
></section>

<script>
  const uploadForm =
    document.getElementById("inventoryUploadForm");

  const previewResult =
    document.getElementById("inventoryPreviewResult");

  uploadForm.addEventListener("submit", async (event) => {
    event.preventDefault();

    const submitButton =
      uploadForm.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');

    submitButton.disabled = true;
    previewResult.hidden = false;
    previewResult.textContent = "Validating inventory...";

    try {
      const response = await fetch(uploadForm.action, {
        method: "POST",
        credentials: "same-origin",
        headers: {
          "X-CSRF-Token": uploadForm.dataset.csrfToken
        },
        body: new FormData(uploadForm)
      });

      const result = await response.json();

      previewResult.replaceChildren();

      const heading = document.createElement("h2");
      heading.textContent = result.message || "Inventory Preview";
      previewResult.appendChild(heading);

      if (response.ok) {
        const summary = document.createElement("p");
        summary.textContent =
          `Total rows: ${result.totalRows} | ` +
          `Valid items: ${result.validCount} | ` +
          `Errors: ${result.errorCount}`;

        previewResult.appendChild(summary);

        if (Array.isArray(result.items)) {
          const list = document.createElement("ul");

          result.items.forEach((item) => {
            const entry = document.createElement("li");
            entry.textContent =
              `${item.name} (${item.itemType})`;
            list.appendChild(entry);
          });

          previewResult.appendChild(list);
        }

        if (Array.isArray(result.errors) &&
            result.errors.length > 0) {
          const errorHeading = document.createElement("h3");
          errorHeading.textContent = "Validation Errors";
          previewResult.appendChild(errorHeading);

          const errorList = document.createElement("ul");

          result.errors.forEach((error) => {
            const entry = document.createElement("li");
            entry.textContent =
              typeof error === "string"
                ? error
                : JSON.stringify(error);
            errorList.appendChild(entry);
          });

          previewResult.appendChild(errorList);
        }
      }
    } catch (error) {
      previewResult.textContent =
        "Unable to preview inventory. Please try again.";
      console.error("Inventory preview failed:", error);
    } finally {
      submitButton.disabled = false;
    }
  });
</script>


      <p class="notice">
        Preview is coming next. No inventory will be saved
        until the import has been validated and confirmed.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2>Spreadsheet Format</h2>
      <p>
        Your spreadsheet should contain these column headers.
        Only name and itemType are required.
      </p>

      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>name</th>
              <th>itemType</th>
              <th>category</th>
              <th>description</th>
              <th>price</th>
              <th>imageUrl</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td>Wireless Mouse</td>
              <td>product</td>
              <td>Electronics</td>
              <td>Bluetooth mouse</td>
              <td>24.99</td>
              <td></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td>Computer Repair</td>
              <td>service</td>
              <td>Technology</td>
              <td>Diagnostic service</td>
              <td>65.00</td>
              <td></td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2>Import Guidelines</h2>
      <p>
        Products and services must have valid names and types.
        Prices cannot be negative. Duplicate entries will be
        identified during validation.
      </p>

      <p class="notice">
        All imported inventory will enter Sky City's moderation
        workflow before becoming publicly visible.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
